      "line": "what the price implies",
      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "At ₹1,172 (NSE close, 16 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since HAVELLS's median return on invested capital of 25.5% is above its 11.63% cost of capital) matches the price if revenue grows about 37.9% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 7.8%; HAVELLS's revenue grew 10.0% a year over FY23–FY26.",
