    {
      "id": "S5",
      "line": "what to watch",
      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "With the other assumptions at base, the valuation is most sensitive to the operating margin (two percentage points either way: a model value of ₹256 to ₹444 a share) and to the cost of capital (one percentage point either way: a model value of ₹301 to ₹416 a share); the Q3 FY27 result will be the next reported quarter.",
